# BANNERFALL: a powderman explodes when it dies: 3 damage to both armies in
# its own column and the one ahead, one row up and down.
game bannerfall
wait 5
cheat battle 18
cheat clear
cheat unit 4 2 7 1 1
cheat unit 3 2 1 0
cheat unit 3 3 3 0
cheat unit 4 1 1 1
cheat unit 1 2 1 0
cheat resolve
expect unit_at42 == 0
expect unit_at32 == 0
expect unit_at41 == 0
expect hp_at43 == 2
expect unit_at22 == 1
